<notice-bar />
<view wx:if="{{closed}}" class="card advisor-card">这个功能暂未开放</view>
<view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="card advisor-card muted">正在加载…</view>
<view wx:elif="{{received}}" class="card advisor-card">已收到。核对需要几天，结果在"奖励规则 → 我的线索"里看</view>
<view wx:elif="{{!ready}}" class="card load-error"><text>{{error}}</text><text class="link" bindtap="load">重试</text></view>
<block wx:else>
  <view class="card advisor-card">
    <view class="advisor-title">补截止日期</view>
    <view wx:if="{{title}}" class="advisor-text">{{title}}</view>
    <view class="advisor-text">填上原文里写的截止日期，并照抄写日期的那句话。我们对照原文核对后才会显示；被采纳送 1 天客户工作台使用期。</view>
    <view class="advisor-text">日期的性质</view>
    <picker range="{{kinds}}" value="{{kindIndex}}" bindchange="kindChange"><view class="exit-btn">{{kinds[kindIndex]}}</view></picker>
    <view class="advisor-text">截止日期</view>
    <picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="exit-btn">{{date || '请选择截止日期'}}</view></picker>
    <view class="advisor-text">时间（选填）</view>
    <picker mode="time" value="{{time}}" bindchange="timeChange"><view class="exit-btn">{{time || '请选择时间'}}</view></picker>
    <text wx:if="{{time}}" class="link" bindtap="clearTime">清除时间</text>
    <view class="advisor-text">原文里的那句话</view>
    <textarea class="advisor-input" value="{{quote}}" maxlength="201" bindinput="quoteChange" placeholder='照抄原文，例如"申报截止时间为 2026 年 10 月 31 日 17:00"' />
    <view class="advisor-text muted">只填公开文件里的原句，不要写姓名、电话等个人信息。采不采纳由我们核对后决定。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="advisor-error">{{error}}</view>
    <button class="btn-primary advisor-button" disabled="{{sending}}" bindtap="submit">提交</button>
  </view>
</block>
<view class="advisor-footer"></view>
